// BADGER barrel — a rigid-body keg (WebNoita §10 package body).
// Fired as the `badger` carrier particle, which hands off its velocity and its
// owner/weapon attribution to this body two ticks out of the muzzle.
// Blueprint mask + stain baked from sprites/s516_1.png (the WL BADGER sprite);
// `material: core:metal` fills the mask, the stain paints the barrel art.
//
// A RADIOACTIVE keg, not a fragile bomb: `hp` is omitted, so it is
// indestructible — shots and blasts shove it around but can NEVER kill it.
// While it sits it pulses `badger_trail` (an invisible r160 contact-damage
// field) every 8 ticks — the low-intensity radiation aura that IS the
// weapon's main effect. It ends only when its long random fuse runs out
// (on.fuse), venting the classic acid burst (badger_dig + 99 radial spray).
